; Lot prices that Ledger divides out of a cost.
;
; $250.50 over 101 FOO does not divide evenly, so the lot price is
; rounded to $2.480198, and the basis rebuilt from it misses $250.50 by
; a tiny residue.  The sale drops that residue from its gain and keeps
; the fifty cents.  No plain dollar amount with cents precedes it, so $
; has no display precision when it is balanced; rounding the gain at
; that precision left the whole journal fifty cents out of balance.
;
; 12.3457 per FUND divides evenly, so the lot price and its basis are
; exact, and the sale keeps the sub-cent digits of its gain.
;
; The residue is at most half a unit in the last place of the rounded
; price for each unit sold.  The FX lot price keeps eight places once $
; has learned two, so on 100001 units the residue stays below a cent,
; and the sale for whole dollars keeps its 99 cents.

2025/01/01 * Buy
    Assets:Brokerage                 101 FOO @@ $250.50
    Equity:Opening

2025/01/02 * Sell
    Assets:Brokerage                -101 FOO {{$250.50}} [2025-01-01] @@ $500
    Assets:Cash                      $500
    Income:Gains:FOO

2025/02/01 * Buy
    Assets:Fund                     9999 FUND @ $12.3457
    Equity:Opening

2025/06/01 * Sell
    Assets:Fund                    -9999 FUND {$12.3457} [2025-02-01] @@ $130000.00
    Assets:Cash                      $130000.00
    Income:Gains:FUND

2025/07/01 * Buy
    Assets:FX                     100001 FX @@ $125000.01
    Equity:Opening                  $-125000.01

2025/07/02 * Sell
    Assets:FX                    -100001 FX {{$125000.01}} [2025-07-01] @@ $150000
    Assets:Cash                      $150000
    Income:Gains:FX

test reg --format '%(account)  %(quantity(amount))\n' Income
Income:Gains:FOO  -249.5
Income:Gains:FUND  -6555.3457
Income:Gains:FX  -24999.99
end test

test bal
          $280500.00  Assets:Cash
         $-248695.16  Equity:Opening
          $-31804.84  Income:Gains
            $-249.50    FOO
           $-6555.35    FUND
          $-24999.99    FX
--------------------
                   0
end test
